/**
 * Briefing generator for the autonomous reviewer executor.
 *
 * Produces a markdown briefing that instructs the executor to run /review-pr,
 * exactly as the implementation briefing instructs /start-implementation.
 *
 * The reviewer reads the PR diff + task spec + technical design, evaluates the
